# Text files are LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows included. With
# core.autocrlf=true a Windows clone got CRLF, and src/platform/sms/nativeBundle.test.ts then
# failed to load scripts/build-sms-parser.mjs ("Invalid or unexpected token"), so `npm test`
# was red on a clean clone. Binary files are detected and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows runs these, and cmd.exe needs CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
